title: Ransomware Encryption of Network Shares
id: 65eaa6a6-ee85-4e22-8e74-8ffdd6707ae0
status: experimental
description: Detects a single process writing ransomware-extension files to remote UNC network shares, indicating ransomware spreading its encryption to file servers and mapped drives.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1486/
logsource:
  category: file_event
detection:
  selection:
    TargetFilename|startswith: '\\\\'
    TargetFilename|endswith:
      - '.locked'
      - '.encrypted'
      - '.crypt'
      - '.enc'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - TargetFilename
  - Image
falsepositives:
  - Backup software writing encrypted archives to shares
level: critical
tags:
  - attack.impact
  - attack.t1486
